<name>Cooling</name>
<ttl id="1000C_S000O_744GD_T006Z" variety="T006Z">
<name>Water Pump Assembly (2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000237L009X" category="A" type-id="8000D" name-id="121DU-00" from="200612">
<name>Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM00000237L009X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM00000237L009X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00003VR00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Water Pump Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that there is no coolant leakage from the drain hole.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A128603J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If coolant is leaking, replace the water pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Check that the bearing has no abnormal noise or catching.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A112198" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If there is abnormal noise or binding, replace the water pump assembly.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
